  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education activities in Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improvement of access, quality and governance through primary and secondary education in the regions of Timbuktu and Kidal, Mali. The project is a collaboration between NRC and IRC.

Additional funding for COVID-19 response: NOK 7.5 million in 2020 - targeting reduced transmission of Covid-19 and other transmissible diseases among targeted populations / people affected by displacement in the regions of Timbuktu and Mopti, Mali</narrative>
  </description>
